      "text_runs": [
        "TWO TRAIT CROSSES",
        "Example 1:",
        "",
        "In tomatoes, red fruit is dominant to yellow fruit, and tall plants are dominant to short plants. A plant that is heterozygous for both traits is crossed with a plant that is heterozygous for the gene encoding height, ",
        "and homozygous recessive for the gene encoding fruit colour",
        ".",
        "",
        "What are the phenotypes & genotypes of the plants being crossed?",
        "",
        "‘Red fruit is dominant to yellow’ so let’s use ‘R’ to represent red and ‘r’ to represent the yellow allele.",
        "Similarly, if ‘tall is dominant to short’ let’s use ‘T’ to represent the tall allele and ‘t’ to represent the short allele. ",
        "",
        "So the parents phenotypes and genotypes are:",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "genotype",
        "phenotype",
        "Plant that is heterozygous for both traits",
        "RrTt",
        "Red and tall",
        "Plant that is heterozygous for height and homozygous recessive for color",
        "rrTt",
        "Yellow and tall"
